  "talents_description": {
    "modifier_tidehunter_1_0": "Strength, Agility, Intellect: 3/6/9",
    "modifier_tidehunter_1_1": "Strength, Agility, Intellect: <b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b>/6/9",
    "modifier_tidehunter_1_2": "Strength, Agility, Intellect: 3/<b><font color='#eabe10'>6</font></b>/9",
    "modifier_tidehunter_1_3": "Strength, Agility, Intellect: 3/6/<b><font color='#eabe10'>9</font></b>",
    "modifier_tidehunter_2_0": "Each attack on the hero has a chance to create a Ravage Tentacle near the enemy.\n\nDamage: 50% of Ravage \n Stun: 50% of Ravage \nChance: 20%/40%/60% \nCooldown: 10/9/8 seconds\n\n If Ravage is not learned, then:\n Damage: 75\nStun: 1 seconds",
    "modifier_tidehunter_2_1": "Each attack on the hero has a chance to create a Ravage Tentacle near the enemy.\n\nDamage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50%</font></b> of Ravage \n Stun: 50% of Ravage \nChance: <b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b>/40%/60% \nCooldown: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10</font></b>/9/8 seconds\n\n If Ravage is not learned, then:\n Damage: 75\nStun: 1 seconds",
    "modifier_tidehunter_2_2": "Each attack on the hero has a chance to create a Ravage Tentacle near the enemy.\n\nDamage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50%</font></b> of Ravage \n Stun: 50% of Ravage \nChance: 20%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>40%</font></b>/60% \nCooldown: 10/<b><font color='#eabe10'>9</font></b>/8 seconds\n\n If Ravage is not learned, then:\n Damage: 75\nStun: 1 seconds",
    "modifier_tidehunter_2_3": "Each attack on the hero has a chance to create a Ravage Tentacle near the enemy.\n\nDamage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50%</font></b> of Ravage \n Stun: 50% of Ravage \nChance: 20%/40%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>60%</font></b> \nCooldown: 10/9/<b><font color='#eabe10'>8</font></b> seconds\n\n If Ravage is not learned, then:\n Damage: 75\nStun: 1 seconds",
    "modifier_tidehunter_3_0": "New Active Ability: Tendrils of the Deep \n\n The hero releases a wave of Ravage tentacles in the target direction, stunning enemies and dealing damage. \n\n Damage: 75% of Ravage \n Stun: 75% of Ravage \n Cast Range: 75% of Ravage \n Mana Cost: 50 \n Cooldown: 15 sec.",
    "modifier_tidehunter_3_1": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Tendrils of the Deep</font></b> \n\n The hero releases a wave of Ravage tentacles in the target direction, stunning enemies and dealing damage. \n\n Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>75%</font></b> of Ravage \n Stun: <b><font color='#eabe10'>75%</font></b> of Ravage \n Cast Range: <b><font color='#eabe10'>75%</font></b> of Ravage \n Mana Cost: 50 \n Cooldown: 15 sec.",
    "modifier_tidehunter_4_0": "Increases Kraken Shell damage block: 15/30",
    "modifier_tidehunter_4_1": "Increases Kraken Shell damage block: <b><font color='#eabe10'>15</font></b>/30",
    "modifier_tidehunter_4_2": "Increases Kraken Shell damage block: 15/<b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b>",
    "modifier_tidehunter_5_0": "Health Regeneration: 0.3%/0.6%",
    "modifier_tidehunter_5_1": "Health Regeneration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>0.3%</font></b>/0.6%",
    "modifier_tidehunter_5_2": "Health Regeneration: 0.3%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>0.6%</font></b>",
    "modifier_tidehunter_6_0": "Increases Ravage damage: 150%/250% of Strength",
    "modifier_tidehunter_6_1": "Increases Ravage damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>150%</font></b>/250% of Strength",
    "modifier_tidehunter_6_2": "Increases Ravage damage: 150%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>250%</font></b> of Strength",
    "modifier_tidehunter_7_0": "Reduces Ravage cooldown: 50 sec. \n\n Increases Ravage stun duration: 1 sec.",
    "modifier_tidehunter_7_1": "Reduces Ravage cooldown: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50</font></b> sec. \n\n Increases Ravage stun duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b> sec.",
