    "modifier_tidehunter_9_0": "New Active Ability: Dead in the Water \n\n Tidehunter attaches a heavy anchor to an enemy hero. The hero is leashed while attached to the anchor. Attempting to move more than 350 units away from the anchor forces the hero to 100 move speed, dragging the anchor behind them. The anchor can be destroyed with 5 hero attacks and deal 200 magic damage. \n\n Cast Range: 350 \n Duration: 10 seconds \n Mana Cost: 80 \n Cooldown: 25 seconds",
    "modifier_tidehunter_9_1": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Dead in the Water</font></b> \n\n Tidehunter attaches a heavy anchor to an enemy hero. The hero is leashed while attached to the anchor. Attempting to move more than 350 units away from the anchor forces the hero to 100 move speed, dragging the anchor behind them. The anchor can be destroyed with <b><font color='#eabe10'>5</font></b> hero attacks and deal <b><font color='#eabe10'>200</font></b> magic damage. \n\n Cast Range: 350 \n Duration: 10 seconds \n Mana Cost: 80 \n Cooldown: 25 seconds",
